            – super Poincaré bracket (supersymmetry)
          %p We discuss spinor bilinear pairings to vectors.
          %h5#over_the_complex_numbers_2 Over the complex numbers
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition_4 Proposition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
