                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/associator"} associator
                  changes sign when one of its arguments is conjugated
                .maruku-equation
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
